## 6. XENO OS THEME SYSTEM (USER-DEFINED VALUES — DO NOT HARDCODE)

All visual identity for Xeno OS — colors, typography, spacing, radii, iconography sizing — is decided by the user, not the AI. This section defines the **token schema only** (the names every panel and shell component is allowed to reference). It intentionally contains **no colors, no font names, no pixel values**. Those live exclusively in `desktop/theme.py` (Python/PySide6 side) and `desktop/shell/theme.ts` (TypeScript/Astal side), which the user authors and edits directly.

**Rule for any AI working in this repo:** never write a literal hex code, font family, or px/rem value inline in a panel, widget, or stylesheet string. Always reference the token by name through the theme module. If a token below is missing a value in `theme.py`/`theme.ts`, stop and either ask the user for it or leave an explicit placeholder — do not substitute a value you think looks reasonable.

### `desktop/theme.py` — Python single source of truth (fill in yourself)
```python
"""
XENO OS THEME — SINGLE SOURCE OF TRUTH (Python / PySide6 side)
Every value below is None until the user defines it. No panel file may
redefine, duplicate, or override these — import `theme` instead.
"""

class XenoTheme:
    # ---- Colors ----
    bg           = None   # main background
    surface      = None   # panel surface
    surface_2    = None   # raised elements / hover states
    border       = None   # borders and dividers
    border_glow  = None   # accent border, opacity baked into the hex itself
    accent       = None   # primary accent
    accent_2     = None   # secondary accent
    accent_hover = None   # accent hover state
    text         = None   # primary text
    text_dim     = None   # secondary / placeholder text
    text_muted   = None   # disabled / hint text
    success      = None
    warning      = None
    error        = None
    overlay      = None   # semi-transparent overlay, alpha baked into the hex

    # ---- Typography ----
    font_primary = None   # e.g. a body/UI font of the user's choice
    font_mono    = None   # e.g. a monospace font of the user's choice
    size_xs   = None       # timestamps, metadata
    size_sm   = None       # secondary labels, hints
    size_base = None       # body text, labels
    size_md   = None       # section headers
    size_lg   = None       # panel titles
    size_xl   = None       # workspace titles
    size_2xl  = None       # clock display
    size_3xl  = None       # login screen clock

    # ---- Spacing & Geometry ----
    radius_sm   = None     # small elements like tags
    radius_md   = None     # panels and cards
    radius_lg   = None     # overlays and launchers
    radius_full = None     # circular elements
    space_xs = None
    space_sm = None
    space_md = None
    space_lg = None
    space_xl = None
    panel_padding    = None
    sidebar_width    = None
    topbar_height    = None
    icon_sm  = None
    icon_md  = None
    icon_lg  = None
    touch_target_min = None

theme = XenoTheme()
```

